cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this research framework, please cite the versioned GitHub release
  and its associated DOI when one becomes available.
type: software
title: 'World Entity and Structural Intelligence Operations: From Variable-Size Block Indexing to Open-Ended World Modeling, Metric Discovery, and Self-Referential Intelligence'
abstract: >-
  WE-SIO is a hypothesis-driven structural-intelligence research framework
  connecting World Entity representations, perspective-aware indexing,
  WE-Hybrid Differential Trees, adaptive intelligence blocks, metric-leaf
  operations, bidirectional constraint and question generation, residual-first
  scientific discovery, constrained delta evolution, self-modeling, and
  collective learning. The v0.1.0 release proposes contracts, counterexamples,
  testable hypotheses, and validation plans; it does not claim empirical
  validation of the proposed architecture.
